### Bestände abrufen (Material Stock)
GET http://localhost:8081/sap/opu/odata/sap/API_MATERIAL_STOCK_SRV/A_MatlStkInAcctMod

### Verbrauch buchen: 2 Stück Enoxaparin (Material Document, Bewegungsart 201)
POST http://localhost:8081/sap/opu/odata/sap/API_MATERIAL_DOCUMENT_SRV/A_MaterialDocumentHeader
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "GoodsMovementCode": "03",
  "MaterialDocumentHeaderText": "Zi. 12, Fr. Müller",
  "to_MaterialDocumentItem": {
    "results": [
      {
        "Material": "MED-ENOX40",
        "Plant": "1710",
        "StorageLocation": "ST03",
        "GoodsMovementType": "201",
        "QuantityInEntryUnit": "2",
        "EntryUnit": "PC",
        "CostCenter": "17101301"
      }
    ]
  }
}

### Fehlerfall: mehr verbrauchen als vorhanden → 400 mit SAP-Fehler M7/021
POST http://localhost:8081/sap/opu/odata/sap/API_MATERIAL_DOCUMENT_SRV/A_MaterialDocumentHeader
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "GoodsMovementCode": "03",
  "to_MaterialDocumentItem": {
    "results": [
      {
        "Material": "MED-ENOX40",
        "Plant": "1710",
        "StorageLocation": "ST03",
        "GoodsMovementType": "201",
        "QuantityInEntryUnit": "100",
        "EntryUnit": "PC",
        "CostCenter": "17101301"
      }
    ]
  }
}
